  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SOTOKACC Shea Butter Production and Marketing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SOTOKACC works with thousands of women in the processing and marketing of shea butter and derived products (shea nut shells) certified 100% organic-Fair for Life. The grant will fund infrastructure and processing equipment, including the 17 sites for shea nut processing, 17 drying areas, 17 warehouses in 17 different shea nut collection areas, a modern filter and a solar drying tunnel for almonds.</narrative>
  </description>
